  {
   "severity": "minor",
   "id": "DL-F-plateau",
   "description": "DL Fig. 3b two-particle exponent at high energy is 3.846 (pixel digitisation, axis calibrated on tick-label centres), not 3.93; the difference exceeds the stated +-0.05 reading uncertainty. Threshold value 4.478 vs 4.45 is within it. Downstream: kappa 0.630 -> 0.617; g^2 for P = 0.1, 1/e, 0.5: 1.67, 3.85, 5.55 (not 1.71, 3.93, 5.67); M_S/m at P = 0.1: 1.87; exp(-F/alpha) = 10^-229 (not 10^-234). No verdict changes.",
   "fix": "Replace F2 = 3.93 by 3.85 in e7_audit.py, the figure legend, results.json, REPORT.md and the summary."
  },
  {
   "severity": "minor",
